From e846959b24f0062b7583d6c16838fcf59a532872 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] iio/backlight: add the CT819 light sensor, pinctrl and
 backlight
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The CT819 (TSL2583-compatible) ambient light sensor with per-unit
calibration, GPIO pin control and the DWI panel backlight.

From the release 2 kernel of the iPad 5 port
(https://github.com/brkosebay/omarchy-ipad5), filtered for OrchardLinux.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
